{
  "$doc": "\u00a723.6 ST-5 (\u00a723.6g), D-P3 LIVE end to end (DESIGN_DP3_Planned_Posts.md \u00a79): agg-behaviors' UnitPostPlanningSystem writes PlannedPosts (138) during Planning; agg-backend's manager (DP3-B) waits for Ready (or 10 s) and Materialise puts the k-th live slot on post k. OBJ = house-3f (10 x 8 m) placed by its SW corner at (125,161) turned 180 deg => footprint x 115-125, y 153-161, storeys at z 0 / 3 / roof 6. Measured at the handover (2.25 s; plan Ready at 0.25 s): all 10 men 0.5 m inside an outer wall, 5 at z 3, 5 at z 0, 5 on the north (enemy-facing) wall; no man on the roof (the plan's survey picked none). The rows read the men, not PlannedPosts' arrays (a fixed buffer is not in the entity dump). Children by NAME <squad>/<composite slot> (F-22, R-8349), listed in `later`. Supersedes the fallback-line rows (R-8337 -> R-8351).",
